<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Eastman Kodak.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Eastman Kodak.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- First Boston said it named Eastman Kodak Co its featured stock of the week.</p>
<p>-- Further details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Shares were up 1-3/4 at 82-3/4 in midmorning exchange trading.</p>
</text>
